  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yemen Joint Response 2022-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &apos;Calibri&apos;,sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;&quot;&gt;For the YJR programming 2022-2023, the main objective is saving and sustaining lives in a protracted emergency setting. ZOA&apos;s key objective remains to continue its WASH programming with a focus on increasing resilience of communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;For the Multi-Purpose Cash (MPC) sector, ZOA and SDF will employ a Group Cash Transfer (GCT) modality. The target locations will be in Hajjah governorate (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &apos;Calibri&apos;,sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;&quot;&gt;Bani Al Awam and Sharas districts)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;and Al Mahwit governorate (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &apos;Calibri&apos;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;&quot;&gt;Al Khabt and Al Mahwit districts).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
